        "definitions": [
          {
            "language": "zh",
            "definition": "服喪明信片",
            "sortOrder": 0
          },
          {
            "language": "en",
            "definition": "A postcard explaining that the sender will refrain from New Year greetings because of a bereavement. Recipients commonly send a winter greeting instead; receiving a New Year card while in mourning is not itself improper.",
            "sortOrder": 0
          },
          {
            "language": "ja",
            "definition": "近親者の不幸により、新年のあいさつを控えることを知らせるはがき。受け取った側は年賀状を控え、寒中見舞いを送ることが多いが、喪中の人が年賀状を受け取ること自体はマナー違反ではない。",
            "sortOrder": 0
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I received a mourning postcard from a friend.",
            "ja": "友達から喪中はがきが届きました。",
            "zh": "我收到了朋友寄來的服喪明信片。",
            "cefrLevel": "A2"
          },
          {
            "en": "I received a mourning postcard, so I decided to send a winter greeting instead of a New Year's card.",
